plugin-hostd-full (0.20.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release 0.20.8: the omx-clap-host floor is the 0.33.1 this pass ships
  * release 0.20.8: floors move to the published plugin-hostd-protocol 0.7.0
  * ci: turn the commit identity check on for pull requests
  * lint: the Fedora 44 refusal matches any 44 in a matrix or block list, and
    a missing workflows dir fails
  * ci: Fedora 45 only (F44 dropped), as omx-dsp and omx-clap-core
  * lint: refuse a Fedora 44 cell in any workflow (red at main until the
    cells move)
  * release.yml: samepass reads the list at the source-ref a dispatch builds
  * release: 0.20.8
  * packaging: floors move to this pass's releases
  * release.yml reads the same-pass list through the shared action
  * commit-msg: the shared stub byte for byte
  * plugin-hostd-full: ranges.py says a breaking release stops and asks the
    owner
  * commit-msg hook: drop the FREEMIXER_DOTGITHUB aliases and the
    ../freemixer-dotgithub fallback
  * plugin-hostd-full: tests/ranges.py holds floors only, and refuses a
    ceiling or a pin
  * plugin-hostd-full: every dependency a floor, no ceiling, in the spec and
    debian/control (red)
  * ci: the RPM and the DEB run by workflow_dispatch only; make check runs in
    lint.yml
  * lint: the one pull-request workflow runs the trigger gate and
    public-sources

